        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Mercedes-Benz Zetros, Lockheed C-130 Hercules, Lockheed L-100\n- Concepts: transport compatibility, aircraft variants, international operation\n\nFacts:\n- The Mercedes-Benz Zetros truck is designed to be compatible with transport by the Lockheed C-130 Hercules.\n- The Mercedes-Benz Zetros truck also fits into a standard German railway carriage.\n- The Lockheed C-130 Hercules has more than forty variants and versions.\n- The Lockheed L-100 is a civilian variant of the Lockheed C-130 Hercules.\n- Lockheed C-130 Hercules variants operate in more than 60 nations.",
